@startuml fig3_data_units
' Diagram 3 of the ISO/IEC 7498-1 pattern: the data units, and how a layer
' hands one to the next.
'
' Conventions: shared/FIGURES.md. Flat boxes, no namespace prefixes, no clause
' numbers, orthogonal edges, nothing explanatory inside the drawing.
'
' What it shows: what a communication transmits, what a protocol data unit is
' made of, and the step that carries a payload from one layer to the layer
' below it.
'
' The composition of 5.6.1 and the mapping of 5.6.2 are the whole of
' encapsulation. A unit is split into what the layer added and what it was
' given, and what one layer hands down becomes the payload of the next. Each
' layer adds its own control information and treats what it received as user
' data, and the two relations below are what makes that checkable in a model
' rather than described in prose.
'
' Every unit sits at the layer that formed it, which is why the same payload
' appears once per layer it passes through.
'
' Left out on purpose:
'  - the communication itself and what it promises: diagram 1
'  - the architecture the units pass through: diagram 2

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam padding 3
skinparam ArrowColor #1A2733
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1A2733
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FCEFC7
  BorderColor #C9A227
  FontColor #1A2733
  FontSize 14
  BorderThickness 1
}

class Association
class DataUnit
class ProtocolDataUnit
class ServiceDataUnit
class UserData
class ProtocolControlInformation
class Layer

DataUnit <|-- ProtocolDataUnit
DataUnit <|-- ServiceDataUnit
DataUnit <|-- UserData
DataUnit <|-- ProtocolControlInformation

Association --> "*" DataUnit : transmits
DataUnit    --> "1" Layer    : atLayer

' What a unit is made of, 5.6.1, and what it becomes one layer down, 5.6.2.
ProtocolDataUnit --> "*" UserData                   : hasUserData
ProtocolDataUnit --> "*" ProtocolControlInformation : hasControlInformation
ProtocolDataUnit --> "*" ServiceDataUnit            : mapsToServiceDataUnit

' Layout only.
UserData -[hidden]right- ProtocolControlInformation

@enduml
